<title>USA: UST Corp increases qtly div.</title>
<headline>UST Corp increases qtly div.</headline>
<dateline>BOSTON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>UST Corp said it increased its quarterly dividend to $0.10 per share from $0.08 per share.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable April 25 to shareholders of record on March 31.</p>
</text>
